mispar yamecha amalei", :gloss "and I will fill the number of your days"} {:he "אמלא", :translit "amalei", :gloss "I will fill"} {:he "ימי שנותינו בהם שבעים שנה", :translit "yemei shenoteinu bahem shiv'im shanah", :gloss "the days of our years in them are seventy years"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :gematria, :a "אמלא", :b "עולה ע\"ב"}], :frame {:text "The verse לא תהיה משכלה appears adjacent in Exodus 23:26. ימי שנותינו בהם שבעים שנה is from Psalms 90:10, a psalm attributed to Moses. The tradition that a person's full lifespan of seventy years excludes the year of birth and the year of death is found in Sotah 2a and is linked to the reading of אמלא as filling the complete count.", :sources ["Exodus 23:26" "Psalms 90:10" "Sotah 2a"]}}], :arithmetic [{:kind :other, :note "Contrast between plural ועבדתם and singular וברך to derive two distinct lessons", :by :selah, :ran? false} {:kind :masorah, :count 3, :occurrences ["וברך" "וברך פרי בטנך" "וברך עלי את אלקנה ואת אשתו"], :by :selah, :located [{:phrase "וברך", :refs ["Exodus 23:25" "Numbers 23:20" "Deuteronomy 7:13" "Deuteronomy 26:15" "1 Samuel 2:20" "2 Samuel 7:29" "Psalms 28:9"], :n 7, :lens :exact} {:phrase "וברך פרי בטנך", :refs ["Deuteronomy 7:13"], :n 1, :lens :exact} {:phrase "וברך עלי את אלקנה ואת אשתו", :refs ["1 Samuel 2:20"], :n 1, :lens :exact}]} {:kind :masorah, :count 3, :occurrences ["מימיך" "ואם מימיך נשתה" "מחוטב עציך עד שואב מימיך"], :by :selah, :located [{:phrase "מימיך", :refs ["Exodus 23:25" "Numbers 20:19" "Deuteronomy 29:10" "1 Samuel 25:28"], :n 4, :lens :exact} {:phrase "ואם מימיך נשתה", :refs ["Numbers 20:19"], :n 1, :lens :exact} {:phrase "מחוטב עציך עד שואב מימיך", :refs ["Deuteronomy 29:10"], :n 1, :lens :plene-insensitive}]} {:kind :masorah, :count 2, :occurrences ["והסירותי" "והסידותי את כפי"], :by :selah, :located [{:phrase "והסירותי", :refs ["Exodus 23:25" "Exodus 33:23" "Exodus 38:3" "1 Samuel 17:46" "2 Samuel 7:15" "1 Kings 2:31" "1 Kings 7:45" "2 Kings 23:27"], :n 20, :lens :plene-insensi